import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 354 | Perfect-Work Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Prevent Dark Turmoil","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 354 | Perfect-Work Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Prevent Dark Turmoil","no":354,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Alaya","Supervision","Dark Turmoil","Institutional Design"],"related":["21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principle","57-Dark Replacement Body Origin and Essence","59-Four Sub-Branches of Dark Replacement Body Disposal"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0354_模块2-完美世界-杜绝黑暗动乱的制度设计.md","filePath":"en/0354_模块2-完美世界-杜绝黑暗动乱的制度设计.md"}'),s={name:"en/0354_模块2-完美世界-杜绝黑暗动乱的制度设计.md"};function o(r,e,l,u,h,d){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-354-perfect-work-alaya-supervision-plan-institutional-design-to-prevent-dark-turmoil" tabindex="-1">Entry 354 | Perfect-Work Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Prevent Dark Turmoil <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-354-perfect-work-alaya-supervision-plan-institutional-design-to-prevent-dark-turmoil" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 354 | Perfect-Work Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Prevent Dark Turmoil&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-Work Full Decomposition (Entry 31 · Institutional Plan) | Benchmark base: Documents 21, 57, 59</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-rather-than-wait-until-darkness-gains-strength-and-then-fight-intervene-when-it-just-shows-its-head" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Rather than wait until darkness gains strength and then fight, intervene when it just shows its head <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-rather-than-wait-until-darkness-gains-strength-and-then-fight-intervene-when-it-just-shows-its-head" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Rather than wait until darkness gains strength and then fight, intervene when it just shows its head&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In Perfect World, dark turmoil always waits until it gains strength before Shi Hao alone pacifies it. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is Alaya Network supervision — changing &quot;post-hoc suppression&quot; to &quot;pre-event identification, early intervention.&quot; This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — to design institutions that prevent dark turmoil. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-status-quo" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Status Quo) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-status-quo" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Status Quo)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Status quo is &quot;suppress only after it gains strength,&quot; each time paying a heavy price. Alaya supervision cuts this waste off at the source.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-status-quo" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Status Quo) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-status-quo" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Status Quo)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Without early identification, darkness always develops from individual alienation to civilization-level turmoil. Alaya supervision cuts this chain.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-status-quo" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Status Quo) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking-status-quo" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking (Status Quo)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao pacifies darkness by &quot;fighting,&quot; not &quot;preventing.&quot; Alaya supervision requires &quot;prevention&quot; to outweigh &quot;fighting.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-this-entry-s-core-·-institutional-design" tabindex="-1">IV. Anchor Symbiosis Alternative (This Entry&#39;s Core · Institutional Design) <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-anchor-symbiosis-alternative-this-entry-s-core-·-institutional-design" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Anchor Symbiosis Alternative (This Entry&#39;s Core · Institutional Design)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alaya supervision plan in three layers:</p><ol><li><strong>Whole-network sensing</strong>: the Alaya Network covers the four-layer structure of material plane, energy layer, consciousness domain, law network, monitoring Dark Replacement Bodies&#39; early signals</li><li><strong>Classified disposal</strong>: per Document 59 divide Dark Replacement Bodies into four sub-branches; after identifying origin, respectively intervene, transform, isolate, not uniformly kill</li><li><strong>Multi-layer supervision</strong>: Anchor Supervisory Committee + Symbiotic Court dual track; anomalies immediately early-warn; observe first then limitedly intervene (causal self-discipline axiom)</li></ol><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Perfect World (Fight After Strength)</th><th>Alaya Supervision (Early Intervention)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Suppress only after darkness gains strength</td><td>Early signals immediately warned</td></tr><tr><td>Uniformly kill</td><td>Four sub-branches classified transformation</td></tr><tr><td>Shi Hao alone disposes</td><td>Multi-layer network coordination</td></tr><tr><td>Treat symptoms not root</td><td>Cut the generation mechanism</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate the dark-generation chain</li><li>Inject Alaya supervision parameters</li><li>Count dark events&#39; interception rate from &quot;showing head&quot; to &quot;gaining strength&quot;</li><li>Output &quot;Alaya Supervision Effectiveness Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Status-quo self-consistency: medium-low; Alaya plan self-consistency: high</strong></li><li><strong>Status-quo retcon risk: high; plan: zero</strong></li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: drops from extreme-leaning-medium to extremely low</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: Alaya supervision&#39;s ethical premise is observe first then limitedly intervene, not indiscriminate monitoring. What it wants to cut is darkness&#39;s generation mechanism, not monitor all beings&#39; thoughts. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s multi-layer supervision design precisely draws the line between early warning and individual freedom — this is the most delicate balance in institutional design.</p><p>One closing line: early warning&#39;s value lies in its quietness. The best supervision is letting darkness never get the chance to speak out, not suppressing it only after it roars.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: early intervention avoids the cost of strength</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: transformation replaces killing</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo has no supervision system; the Alaya plan gives a deployable early-warning mechanism</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Myriad Ranks are all nodes of the Alaya Network</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the supervision network can extend cross-plane</li></ul><p>Add one more layer: Alaya supervision is not to catch more people, but to let fewer die. Its goal is to identify and transform darkness before it harms anyone. This is a tenderness that moves cost forward to the early-warning stage.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-institutional-prevention-of-dark-turmoil" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Institutional Prevention of Dark Turmoil <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-institutional-prevention-of-dark-turmoil" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Institutional Prevention of Dark Turmoil&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The institutional design to prevent dark turmoil has as its core the Alaya Network&#39;s multi-layer monitoring and the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s resource universal benefit, two-pronged. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s law-first axiom ensures the network automatically intervenes when resource concentration reaches a dangerous threshold; the universal equal infinite law eliminates predation motivation at the root. Dark turmoil is not unavoidable natural disaster, but human-made disaster of the predatory system — institutions changed, human-made disasters gone. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s 300-year tracking data proves this.</p><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-dual-insurance-of-monitoring-and-universal-benefit" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Dual Insurance of Monitoring and Universal Benefit <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-dual-insurance-of-monitoring-and-universal-benefit" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Dual Insurance of Monitoring and Universal Benefit&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The institutional design to prevent dark turmoil is dual insurance: monitoring and universal benefit. The Alaya Network&#39;s multi-layer monitoring is responsible for detecting early signals such as resource concentration and mind deviation; the universal equal infinite law is responsible for eliminating predation motivation at the root — since Origin is infinite, predation is not worth it. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s 300-year tracking data proves that after both insurances are simultaneously enabled, dark-turmoil-type events drop from average three per century to zero. The law-first axiom ensures monitoring does not overstep — it only early-warns, does not adjudicate; adjudication rests with the Symbiotic Court.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dark turmoil should not be a natural disaster that an Emperor Immortal alone pacifies every so often. Alaya supervision&#39;s logic is simple: rather than wait for the fire to start before putting it out, install a whole-network smoke alarm. This is institutions&#39; tenderness toward loneliness.</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · Alaya supervision plan to prevent dark turmoil described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./334_模块2-完美世界-掠夺体系的必然产物.html">Entry 334 · Dark-Turmoil Source</a> · <a href="./346_模块2-完美世界-掠夺体系的受害者与加害者.html">Entry 346 · Dark Beings</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principle</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',34)])])}const p=i(s,[["render",o]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
